   "elements": [
    {
     "id": "97d2abbb",
     "elType": "widget",
     "widgetType": "html",
     "settings": {
      "html": "<section class=\"band--cream\" data-el=\"page.blocks\" data-el-build=\"elementor\">\n  <div class=\"wrap section\">\n    <h2 class=\"h2 mb-l reveal\" style=\"max-width:26ch\">How support is intended to work.</h2>\n    <div class=\"hairline\" style=\"--min:260px\" data-stagger>\n      <div class=\"cell\" style=\"min-height:240px;padding:34px 28px 38px\"><span class=\"num\">01</span><h3 class=\"h3\">Alongside training</h3><p style=\"font-size:15.5px\">Study time sits inside the program schedule rather than competing with it, so participants are not choosing between the two.</p></div><div class=\"cell\" style=\"min-height:240px;padding:34px 28px 38px\"><span class=\"num\">02</span><h3 class=\"h3\">Shared reporting</h3><p style=\"font-size:15.5px\">Where a school partnership is in place, coaches and educators work from the same progress information — with consent.</p></div><div class=\"cell\" style=\"min-height:240px;padding:34px 28px 38px\"><span class=\"num\">03</span><h3 class=\"h3\">No clinical claims</h3><p style=\"font-size:15.5px\">Academic coaching is not assessment, diagnosis or regulated therapeutic support, and is never described as such.</p></div><div class=\"cell\" style=\"min-height:240px;padding:34px 28px 38px\"><span class=\"num\">04</span><h3 class=\"h3\">Data minimisation</h3><p style=\"font-size:15.5px\">Public forms ask for the least information needed. Anything sensitive moves to an approved secure process later.</p></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
     },
     "elements": []
    }
   ]
  },
